sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Host (browser A)
  participant B as Guest (browser B)
  participant W as Worker
  participant DO as RoomServer (partyserver · Durable Object)
  participant E as Engine (pure rules)
  participant AI as Claude via AI Gateway
  participant DB as D1

  rect rgb(8, 42, 33)
    Note over A,DB: Create and join
    A->>W: POST /api/rooms {settings}
    W->>DO: init(code, seed)
    W-->>A: {code, url} → go to /r/CODE
    A->>W: GET /r/CODE → single-page app (Vite build)
    A->>DO: WebSocket /ws/CODE · hello {id, secret, name} (Zod-validated)
    DO-->>A: snapshot (lobby, you are host)
    A-->>B: share the room link
    B->>DO: hello {id, secret, name}
    DO-->>A: snapshot (2 players)
    DO-->>B: snapshot
    A->>DO: settings · addBot · list publicly (host only)
    DO->>E: updateSettings / addPlayer(bot)
    A->>DO: start
    DO->>E: startGame → haul 1 · bots decide
  end

  loop 8 hauls · cargo 120 → 480 plus drifting carry-over
    DO-->>A: snapshot: choosing (deadline)
    DO-->>B: snapshot: choosing
    opt Ask the Broker (once per haul, private)
      B->>DO: broker
      DO->>E: engine: reads + sampled recommendation (per player seed)
      DO->>AI: rewrite briefing · JSON schema output (≤ 9 s)
      AI-->>DO: prose only · recommendation never changes · timeout → heuristic
      DO-->>B: advice (only B receives it)
    end
    A->>DO: choose COLLECT or STEAL
    DO-->>B: snapshot: A locked in (choice hidden)
    alt everyone locks in
      B->>DO: choose
    else timer expires
      DO->>DO: alarm → undecided crew COLLECT (flagged)
    end
    DO->>E: resolveRound → outcome · deltas · carry-over
    DO-->>A: snapshot: reveal (calls go live, manifest)
    DO-->>B: snapshot: reveal
    alt host continues
      A->>DO: next
    else reveal timer
      DO->>DO: alarm → advance
    end
  end

  rect rgb(8, 42, 33)
    Note over A,DB: Game over and rematch
    DO->>E: advance → finished · winners (ties: fewer steals) · series +1
    DO->>DB: record game · player rows · stats (async)
    DO-->>A: final manifest + template mission log
    DO-->>B: final manifest + template mission log
    DO->>AI: mission log (async)
    AI-->>DO: text → mission log updated for everyone
    A->>DO: rematch vote
    B->>DO: rematch vote (all humans in → go)
    DO->>E: resetForRematch · seat spectators · startGame (game 2)
  end

  Note over A,DO: Any time: reload or reconnect → hello with the same {id, secret} reclaims the seat and the pending secret choice
